    "version": "0.2.1",
    "last_updated": "2026-09-28",
    "doc_role": "Per-chassis geometric data for the SVG wheel-well visualization. WHEEL-RELATIVE measurements: factory clearance from each side of the OEM tire to its nearest constraint (fender, strut/suspension, driveshaft, brake caliper).",
